ods or the provision of the services.\n                </li>\n                <li>\n                    All our contractual relations will be governed exclusively by <t t-out="company_country"/> law.\n                </li>\n            </ol>\n        </div>\n    </t>\n\n	f	t	2026-04-07 03:09:00.605908	2026-04-07 03:09:00.605908	f
